nt"><article class=3D"style_learnContent__K5K7M"><header><strong class=3D"s=
tyle_chapter__grtAe">13</strong><h1>Design an ATM System</h1></header><p>In=
 this chapter, we will explore the object-oriented design of an ATM system.=
 The primary purpose of an ATM is to automate banking tasks for users, allo=
wing them to check balances, withdraw cash, and transfer funds. This design=
 aims to make these operations seamless by designing classes that model key=
 components, such as the ATM machine, bank accounts, hardware interfaces, a=
nd transaction states.</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
