 for the initial 'Insert Card,' have connections back to the customer, indi=
cating that the customer interacts with the ATM at each step. Finally, all =
paths converge to the 'Eject Card' state, concluding the transaction." load=
ing=3D"lazy" width=3D"624" height=3D"457" decoding=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"1=
