meters), `validateCard` (returning a boolean and taking a card number Strin=
g), `checkPin` (returning a boolean and taking card number and pin number S=
trings), `getAccountByAccountNumber` (returning an `Account` object and tak=
ing an account number String), `getAccountByCard` (returning an `Account` o=
bject and taking a card number String), and `withdrawFunds` (returning a bo=
