<h3 id=3D"transaction">Transaction</h3>
<p>The purpose of designing the Transaction class is to provide a unified f=
ramework for handling financial operations in the ATM system, enabling the =
system to process withdrawals and deposits consistently and reliably.</p>
<p>The Transaction class, as an interface, defines a contract for all trans=
action types, supported by a TransactionType enum that specifies Withdraw a=
nd Deposit operations. It validates transactions, such as checking funds fo=
r withdrawals, and updates the account balance, using concrete classes like=
 WithdrawTransaction and DepositTransaction for reliable processing.</p>
<div class=3D"info-box"><img alt=3D"Design Choice" loading=3D"lazy" width=
=3D"20" height=3D"20" decoding=3D"async" data-nimg=3D"1" src=3D"https://byt=
