ated-teller-machine-atm/design-choice-T3SCDB4L.svg" style=3D"color: transpa=
rent;"><p><strong>Design choice:</strong> By abstracting Transaction as a s=
eparate object, we can represent
different transaction types (e.g., Withdraw, Deposit) with shared behavior,=
 making
it easier to introduce new types in the future without modifying the core l=
ogic.</p></div>
