<h3 id=3D"atmmachine-1">ATMMachine</h3>
<p>The ATMMachine class acts as the central controller of the ATM system, a=
pplying the Facade pattern to offer a simplified interface to the underlyin=
g complexities. It manages the ATM=E2=80=99s hardware components, delegates=
